text MtPyre_3F_Text_GabriellePostRematch {
    format("POKéMON no longer of this world.\nPOKéMON that are with you now.\pAnd the POKéMON that you will meet\nin the future…\pThey are all to be equally cherished.\nI see that you've remembered that.$")
}

text MtPyre_3F_Text_GabrielleRegister {
    format("I would like to see your POKéMON\nwhen they grow up some more…\pPlease, I need to see your POKéNAV.$")
}
